 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">《Evilos》是一款动作塔防游戏，你将扮演一位远古的邪恶巫师，抵御卫道士无穷无尽的进攻浪潮。用海量可进化的魔法武器与法术夷平整个王国，并在 10 个章节中以精英仆从巩固你的防线。这一次，你就是最终BOSS！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/26dfcd098ee1cb4664e1f1b39dbe4b52.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/26dfcd098ee1cb4664e1f1b39dbe4b52.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/26dfcd098ee1cb4664e1f1b39dbe4b52.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">用陨石、龙卷风、闪电等毁灭法术，将所有英雄消灭殆尽。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/f7937501bbedfd8b7dbaa02b4121cc88.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/f7937501bbedfd8b7dbaa02b4121cc88.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/f7937501bbedfd8b7dbaa02b4121cc88.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">释放你的魔法枪械军火库，将敌人冰冻、灼烧、电击并彻底瓦解。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/d9fffa0e64adb3bba43a880ff405a2d6.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/d9fffa0e64adb3bba43a880ff405a2d6.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/d9fffa0e64adb3bba43a880ff405a2d6.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">唤醒亡者，让他们成为你的贴身护卫。杰克马罗、尼古拉斯骨笼、斯凯瑞波特、文森特梵戈尔和阿诺德施瓦辛尸随时听候你的调遣！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/62bc9bb701f4634e5e86e24f8d73c87c.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/62bc9bb701f4634e5e86e24f8d73c87c.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/62bc9bb701f4634e5e86e24f8d73c87c.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">升级并进化你的武器与法术，让它们化为更加致命的全新形态。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/d18637b53607fa1559476667e4200490.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/d18637b53607fa1559476667e4200490.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/d18637b53607fa1559476667e4200490.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">通过遍布王国的 10 个章节向世界复仇，每个章节都以一场极具挑战的首领战收尾。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >主要特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>扮演反派</strong> — 一位远古邪恶巫师，沉睡千年后苏醒，只为夺回被窃取的力量</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>受诅咒的军火库</strong> — 探索海量武器与法术组合，创造美妙而邪恶的连招，摧毁你的敌人</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>升级与进化</strong> — 每件武器和法术都可升级并进化为更加致命的最终形态</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>唤醒亡者</strong> — 号令堕落的勇者成为你的贴身仆从</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>征服整个王国</strong> — 100 个关卡分为 10 个章节，每章都以一场史诗级首领战收尾</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>王国将你封印，还称之为美满结局。是时候改写它了——将 Evilos 加入愿望单，成为最终 BOSS。</i></strong></p>",
